# Task Management REST API

A RESTful Task Management API built with FastAPI that allows users to register, authenticate, and manage their personal tasks securely using JWT authentication.

## Features

- User registration with password hashing
- User login with JWT authentication
- Secure endpoints using OAuth2 Bearer Token
- Create, read, update, and delete tasks
- Retrieve all tasks belonging to the authenticated user
- Filter tasks by status
- PostgreSQL database integration using SQLAlchemy ORM
- Automated unit tests using Pytest

